[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613716699","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98686#issuecomment-2613716699","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98686","id":2613716699,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6byibb","user":{"login":"quinnyo","id":3379314,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzkzMTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3379314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo","html_url":"https://github.com/quinnyo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinnyo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T01:52:23Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T01:52:23Z","body":"I noticed this today (on v4.4.beta1.official [d33da79d3])\n\nI can't see any reason for it being designed like this. It seems like a mistake to me.\n\nIf there is some reason for the current behaviour, it would be great if someone could please let me know. I'm happy to discuss it further!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613716699/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613720583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98686#issuecomment-2613720583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98686","id":2613720583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6byjYH","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T01:58:20Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T01:58:20Z","body":"#100554 fixes it but I'm not sure why it's not being picked up. I think it needs more 👍?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613720583/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613743517","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98686#issuecomment-2613743517","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98686","id":2613743517,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6byo-d","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T02:58:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T03:01:34Z","body":"@quinnyo I guess the reason why the old behavior doesn't support bind and unbind at the same time is that the most common usage of using bind and unbind is only using bind or only using unbind. However we are allowed to use bind and unbind at the same time by code like:\n```\n@tool\nextends EditorScript\n\nfunc f(a = 0, b = 0, c = 0, d = 0, e = 0, f = 0, g = 0, h = 0):\n    return [a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h]\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n    f.bind(1, 2)\n    f.bind(1, 2).unbind(1)\n    f.bind(1, 2).unbind(1).bind(3, 4)\n    f.bind(1, 2).unbind(1).bind(3, 4).unbind(1)\n    \n    f.bind(1).bind(2).bind(3).unbind(1)\n    f.bind(1).bind(2).unbind(1).bind(3)\n    f.bind(1).unbind(1).bind(2).bind(3)\n    f.unbind(1).bind(1).bind(2).bind(3)\n    \n    f.unbind(1).unbind(1).unbind(1).bind(1, 2, 3)\n    f.unbind(1).unbind(1).bind(1, 2, 3).unbind(1)\n    f.unbind(1).bind(1, 2, 3).unbind(1).unbind(1)\n    f.bind(1, 2, 3).unbind(1).unbind(1).unbind(1)\n```\nThe order and count of using bind and unbind are very important and different combinations of them can cause different results . However it's may not very simple to clarify by GUI. I guess that's also a main reason why they haven't supported using them at the same time.\n\nHey, thx for your fixes @Macksaur . I give it a 👍. But I don't know why it's not being picked up.\nI notice you say this fix behaves like `source_signal.connect(target_function.bind(args).unbind(n))`,\nI'm looking forward to using any kind of combination of order and count of `bind` and `unbind`, maybe by a form of list which can re-order its elements by buttons or drag-and-drop.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613743517/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613747049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98686#issuecomment-2613747049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98686","id":2613747049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6byp1p","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T03:06:47Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T03:06:47Z","body":"> I'm looking forward to using any kind of combination of order and count of bind and unbind, maybe by a form of list which can re-order its elements by buttons or drag-and-drop.\n\nCan you give an example of a specific problem you're facing that would be solved by arbitrary reordering?\n\nI did it that way because a premade signal has parameters that you cannot get rid of otherwise. They must be removed before allowing the appending of the custom parameters that your target function actually cares about. You ideally shouldn't be adding any further parameters beyond this in the GUI, only to unbind them.\n\nCustom reordering imo is best done entirely in code. The GUI just needs to support the 99% case.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613747049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613750222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98686#issuecomment-2613750222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98686","id":2613750222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6byqnO","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T03:16:05Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T03:16:05Z","body":"Yes, you are right. I misunderstood the function of `unbind` in this GUI, in fact it's for `Unbind Signal Arguments` not `Unbind method Arguments`. So what I said was invalid.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613750222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613751081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98686#issuecomment-2613751081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98686","id":2613751081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6byq0p","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T03:18:20Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T03:19:04Z","body":"It is ok, it is good food for thought. One day I'd like to be able to reorder the function's parameters properly and not use clunky bind/unbind. But small steps first!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613751081/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2924341327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98686#issuecomment-2924341327","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98686","id":2924341327,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uTehP","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T05:27:40Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T05:44:37Z","body":"Because it is currently LIFO instead of FIFO, using both at the same time is not very meaningful and may increase the probability of error.\n\nYou can try to output the argument list of the receive method after creating the connection.\n\nEspecially for `bind()`, it is not recommended to call it multiple times in a row.\n\n`bind(a, b).bind(c, d, e).bind(f)` <==> `f, c, d ,e, a, b`\n\nUsing `unbind()` makes the situation more complicated.\n\n`bind(a, b).unbind(2).bind(c, d, e).bind(f)` <==> `f, c, a, b`\n`unbind(2).bind(a, b).bind(c, d, e).bind(f)` <==> `f, c, d, e`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2924341327/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]